{"id":"ldb-ex-int-002","lessonId":"ldb-int-006","title":"TypeConverter برای Instant","description":"دو Converter برای Instant و Long بنویسید.","type":"WRITE_CODE","difficulty":"MEDIUM","starterCode":"class Converters { /* TODO */ }","expectedOutput":"Instant به epoch millis ذخیره و بازسازی شود.","hints":["toEpochMilli","null را حفظ کنید"],"solution":"@TypeConverter fun fromInstant(v:Instant?)=v?.toEpochMilli()\n@TypeConverter fun toInstant(v:Long?)=v?.let(Instant::ofEpochMilli)","explanation":"SQLite نوع Instant ندارد."}